I. Muc tieu chuong trinh

Xay dung chuong trinh Worker Management de quan ly thong tin cong nhan va lich su thay doi luong.
Chuong trinh cho phep nguoi dung thuc hien cac chuc nang:

Them cong nhan moi vao he thong.
Tang luong cho cong nhan.
Giam luong cho cong nhan.
Luu lai lich su thay doi luong.
Hien thi thong tin lich su thay doi luong.

* Thong tin cua Worker can quan ly
Dieu kien du lieu:
ID phai bat dau bang ky tu W va theo sau la chu so.
Name chi chua chu cai va khoang trang.
Age nam trong khoang tu 18 den 50.
Salary phai lon hon 0.
Work Location chi chua chu cai, so va khoang trang.
* Cac chuc nang yeu cau
Function 1: Add Worker
Cho phep them mot cong nhan moi.
Yeu cau:
Nhap day du thong tin Worker.
Kiem tra du lieu dau vao.
Khong cho phep Worker co ID bi trung.
Neu them thanh cong, Worker duoc luu vao danh sach quan ly.

Function 2: Up Salary
Cho phep tang luong cho Worker.
Yeu cau:
Worker phai ton tai trong he thong.
Amount phai lon hon 0.
Sau khi tang luong:
Cap nhat salary moi.
Tao mot ban ghi SalaryHistory.

Function 3: Down Salary
Cho phep giam luong cho Worker.
Yeu cau:
Worker phai ton tai.
Amount phai lon hon 0.
Salary sau khi giam khong duoc nho hon 0.
Luu lai lich su giam luong.

Function 4: Display Information Salary
Hien thi lich su thay doi luong.
Yeu cau:
Hien thi thong tin:
Code
Name
Age
Salary
Status
Date
Sap xep lich su theo ID Worker.

Function 5: Exit
Thoat chuong trinh.

II. Giai thich tong quat chuong trinh

1. Y tuong chuong trinh

Chuong trinh quan ly Worker bang cach su dung cac lop:

Worker: luu thong tin cong nhan.
SalaryHistory: luu lich su thay doi luong.
ManagerWorker: quan ly danh sach Worker.
ManagerSalaryHistory: quan ly danh sach lich su.
Controller: xu ly yeu cau tu nguoi dung.
Main: hien thi menu va chay chuong trinh

III. Kiem tra hop le du lieu dau vao

1. Worker ID (Dung Regex [Ww]\d+):
Hop le: Nhap chuoi bat dau bang chu 'W' hoac 'w' theo sau la cac chu so (Vi du: W1, w100). Chuong trinh se tu dong chuyen thanh chu hoa (W1).
Ngoai le: Nhap sai dinh dang (Vi du: ABC, 123, W_1) → He thong bao "Invalid!" va bat nhap lai.
Test case:

* Input: W1
Expected: Hop le, tao Worker voi ID W1.
* Input: w100
Expected: Hop le, tu dong chuyen thanh W100.
* Input: ABC, 123, W_1, W@
Expected: Bao "Invalid!" va yeu cau nhap lai.
* Input: W0
Expected: Hop le vi Regex chi kiem tra W + chu so.

2. Name (Dung Regex [A-Za-z\s]+):
Hop le: Nhap chuoi chi chua chu cai va khoang trang (Vi du: Nguyen Van A).
Ngoai le: Nhap chuoi chua so hoac ky tu dac biet (Vi du: An123, Binh@) → He thong bao "Invalid!" va bat nhap lai.
Test case:

* Input: Nguyen Van A
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: John Smith
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: An123, Binh@, John1
Expected: Bao "Invalid!" va nhap lai.
* Input: 12345
Expected: Khong hop le.

3. Age (Dung Range [18, 50]):
Hop le: Nhap so nguyen trong pham vi tu 18 den 50.
Ngoai le: Nhap so < 18 hoac > 50 hoac khong phai so → He thong bao "age >= 18 and <=50 !" va bat nhap lai.
Test case:

* Input: 18
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: 50
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: 17, 51
Expected: Khong hop le.
* Input: abc
Expected: Bao loi nhap so.

4. Salary / Amount (Dung Range Double.MIN_VALUE -> MAX_VALUE va kiem tra logic > 0):
Hop le: Nhap so thuc lon hon 0.
Ngoai le: Nhap so <= 0 hoac khong phai so → He thong nem Exception/Bao loi: "salary must be > 0" va bat nhap lai.
Test case:

* Input: 1000
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: 0.5
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: 0, -100, abc
Expected: Bao "salary must be > 0".
Boundary test:
* Input: 0
Expected: Fail.
* Input: Double.MIN_VALUE
Expected: Pass.

5. Work Location (Dung Regex [A-Za-z0-9\s]+):
Hop le: Nhap chuoi chua chu cai, so va khoang trang (Vi du: Hanoi Shop 1).
Ngoi le: Nhap ky tu dac biet (Vi du: Hanoi#1) → He thong bao "Invalid!" va bat nhap lai.
Test case:

* Input: Hanoi
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: Hanoi Shop 1
Expected: Hop le.
* Input: Hanoi#1, Factory@
Expected: Bao "Invalid!".

Cac gia tri bien can kiem tra:
Age:

* 17 -> Fail
* 18 -> Pass
* 50 -> Pass
* 51 -> Fail
Salary:
* -1 -> Fail
* 0 -> Fail
* > 0 -> Pass
> Amount:


* -1 -> Fail
* 0 -> Fail
* > 0 -> Pass



IV. Chuc nang Add Worker (Option 1)
Test Case 1: Add Worker thanh cong
Input:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi
Expected:
Add success
Worker:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi

Test Case 2: ID chu thuong
Input:
w02 | David | 30 | 2000 | HCM
Expected:
W02 | David | 30 | 2000 | HCM
(ID duoc chuyen thanh chu hoa)

Test Case 3: Trung ID
Danh sach hien co:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi
Input:
W01
Expected:
Worker with ID W01 already exists. Please input again

Test Case 4: Age khong hop le
Input:
W03 | Tom | 17 | 1500 | Da Nang
Expected:
age >= 18 and <=50 !

Test Case 5: Salary khong hop le
Input:
W04 | Alex | 25 | 0 | Hanoi
Expected:
salary must be > 0

V. Chuc nang Up Salary (Option 2)
Test Case 1: Tang luong thanh cong
Worker hien tai:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi
Input:
Code = W01
Amount = 500
Expected:
Salary moi:
W01 | John | 25 | 1500 | Hanoi
History:
W01 | John | 25 | 1500 | UP

Test Case 2: Danh sach rong
Input:
Option 2
Expected:
List is empty!

Test Case 3: ID khong ton tai
Input:
Code = W99
Expected:
Can not found code!

Test Case 4: Amount = 0
Input:
Amount = 0
Expected:
salary must be > 0

Test Case 5: Amount am
Input:
Amount = -100
Expected:
salary must be > 0

VI. Chuc nang Down Salary (Option 3)
Test Case 1: Giam luong thanh cong
Worker hien tai:
W01 | John | 25 | 5000 | Hanoi
Input:
Amount = 2000
Expected:
W01 | John | 25 | 3000 | Hanoi
History:
W01 | John | 25 | 3000 | DOWN

Test Case 2: Giam bang luong hien tai
Worker hien tai:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi
Input:
Amount = 1000
Expected:
W01 | John | 25 | 0 | Hanoi
History:
W01 | John | 25 | 0 | DOWN

Test Case 3: Amount lon hon luong hien tai
Worker hien tai:
W01 | John | 25 | 1000 | Hanoi
Input:
Amount = 1500
Expected:
Amount must be smaller than current salary (1000.0)!
Yeu cau nhap lai.

Test Case 4: ID khong ton tai
Input:
Code = W99
Expected:
Can not found code!

Test Case 5: Danh sach rong
Expected:
List is empty!

VII. Chuc nang Display Information Salary (Option 4)
//test du lieu bao gom 3 nguoi.
// up/down 7-9 lan

Test Case 1: Hien thi lich su
History:
W03 | James | 40 | 2200 | DOWN
W02 | David | 30 | 2500 | DOWN
W01 | John | 25 | 1500 | UP
Expected:
Code Name Age Salary Status Date
W01 John 25 1500 UP
W02 David 30 2500 DOWN
W03 James 40 2200 DOWN

Test Case 2: Kiem tra sap xep theo ID
History:
W03 | James | 40 | 2200 | DOWN
W01 | John | 25 | 1500 | UP
W02 | David | 30 | 2500 | DOWN

Expected:
W01 | John | 25 | 1500 | UP
W02 | David | 30 | 2500 | DOWN
W03 | James | 40 | 2200 | DOWN

Test Case 3: History rong
Expected:
History Salary is empty
Test Case 4: Trung lich su
Input:
Them lai record da ton tai.

Expected:
This record history is existed!!!

